tiny_voca_ptbr/text.py and tiny_voca_ptbr/voice.py are modified copies of
upstream files; their docstrings say what changed.

The model weights were trained from random initialization on speech generated
by Kokoro-82M (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, Apache License 2.0)
with its voices pf_dora, af_heart and pm_santa. No Kokoro weights or voice
files are included.

Phonemes come from eSpeak NG (https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng,
GPL-3.0-or-later), which is called as a separate program and is not included.
